          ]
        },
        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b136978-aF9vqp3LdMeV.png"
        },
        "description": "Fumiya Tomozaki is a high school student who is a friendless loner and an outcast in school. To escape from his lonely existence, he dedicated himself to a fighting game called Attack Family, or 'Tackfam' for short, so much so that he's the number one ranked player in Japan, his username being nanashi. \n\nTomozaki sees himself as a \"bottom-tier character\" in life: someone born unlucky and destined for loneliness. However, after meeting his online rival, [Aoi Hinami](https://anilist.co/character/136977/Aoi-Hinami), he agrees to learn from her how to socialize and improve himself, treating life as a game to be mastered.",
        "gender": "Male",
        "age": "17"
      },
