        },
        "description": "**Height:** 162 cm (5'3.2\")\n\nShe is an energetic, mischievous, and popular classmate of [Fumiya Tomozaki](https://anilist.co/character/136978) who is in the track and field club together with [Aoi Hinami](https://anilist.co/character/136977). She has a close friendship with [Hanabi Natsubayashi](https://anilist.co/character/161223). Although she maintains a cheerful demeanor, in truth she has insecurities about herself and her personality that gives in easily to not ruin the mood. She is also known to be quite persistent in what she wants to achieve, such as pestering the lonely Hanabi into being her friend.",
