        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b136979-KZW38ANA8Xsc.png"
        },
        "description": "Fuuka is a reserved and book-loving classmate of [Fumiya](https://anilist.co/character/136978/Tomozaki-Fumiya) who often spends time at the library. As she is an aspiring novelist, she loves to speculate about and study different people's motives for their actions and experiences that shaped them to who they are today. \n\nHer favorite author is Michael Andi.",
